\f1\i (1)Full forms and one-line use:\

\f2\b0 HTTP:(Hypertext transfer protocol)\
Used to transfer web pages between a browser and a web server.\
\
HTTPS:(Hypertext transfer protocol secure)\
A secure version of HTTP that encrypts data during communication.\
\
FTP:(File transfer protocol)\
Used to transfer files between computers over a network.\
\
SMTP:(Simple mail transfer protocol)\
Used to send emails from one mail server to another.\
\

